a:3:{s:3:"key";s:32:"cms:how_it_works:sections_active";s:10:"expires_at";i:1786958152;s:4:"data";a:4:{i:0;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:8;s:5:"title";s:30:"Choose Your Product Components";s:6:"body_1";s:461:"<p>Unleash your brand's potential with&nbsp;<span class="theme-color-font fw-bold">mybrandplease.com</span>. Explore our extensive range of over 200+ formulations across body, skin, and hair care, carefully crafted for professional-grade results. Experience the luxury of high-quality ingredients, including naturally derived and certified organic components. Tailor your products to perfection with our diverse packaging options and captivating fragrances.</p>";s:6:"body_2";s:168:"<p>Handpick your favorites, knowing they will captivate and delight your cherished clients. Embark on a sensory journey and sample our extraordinary products today.</p>";s:10:"image_path";s:90:"uploads/how-it-works/93b9eb24519878c10181cf488453ffd54758561c365248eb927316ca6769fdfa.webp";s:10:"sort_order";i:1;s:9:"is_active";i:1;s:10:"created_at";s:19:"2026-08-17 14:31:43";s:10:"updated_at";s:19:"2026-08-17 14:31:43";}i:1;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:2;s:5:"title";s:21:"Define Your Offerings";s:6:"body_1";s:242:"Harness the power of your brand's message and fine-tune your opening order. Define product names, quantities, and sizes to perfection. Make key decisions that will shape your product line. Take control and let us bring your vision to reality.";s:6:"body_2";s:225:"Explore our blog for invaluable expert tips and tricks. Seize this opportunity to create a remarkable brand experience. Check out our blog for our expert tips &amp; tricks <a href="blog.php" class="theme-color-font">here</a>.";s:10:"image_path";s:65:"assets/imgs/how-it-works/Define-Your-Offerings-min-2048x1244.webp";s:10:"sort_order";i:2;s:9:"is_active";i:1;s:10:"created_at";s:19:"2026-08-13 15:13:09";s:10:"updated_at";s:19:"2026-08-13 15:13:09";}i:2;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:3;s:5:"title";s:23:"Label Design & Printing";s:6:"body_1";s:191:"Embark on your design journey with meticulous planning and make your labels shine. Our expert Graphic Designers are poised to create stunning logos and labels for your personal care products.";s:6:"body_2";s:249:"Benefit from our comprehensive design services or utilize our templates to collaborate with your own team. Experience the added convenience of our in-house digital print services or explore external options for unique finishes and metallic elements.";s:10:"image_path";s:65:"assets/imgs/how-it-works/Label-Design-Printing-min-2048x1243.webp";s:10:"sort_order";i:3;s:9:"is_active";i:1;s:10:"created_at";s:19:"2026-08-13 15:13:09";s:10:"updated_at";s:19:"2026-08-13 15:13:09";}i:3;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:4;s:5:"title";s:17:"Finishing Touches";s:6:"body_1";s:187:"Elevate your brand with exceptional exterior packaging and exquisite finishing touches. Enhance your marketing presence and create a luxurious impression by adding premium exterior boxes.";s:6:"body_2";s:224:"Ensure optimal protection during shipping and explore options like seals, shrink wrap, inserts, and promotional materials to make your products truly distinctive. Invest in finer details that leave a long-lasting impression.";s:10:"image_path";s:59:"assets/imgs/how-it-works/Finishing-Touches-min-768x467.webp";s:10:"sort_order";i:4;s:9:"is_active";i:1;s:10:"created_at";s:19:"2026-08-13 15:13:09";s:10:"updated_at";s:19:"2026-08-13 15:13:09";}}}